@startuml api-bet-place
title POST /api/bet/place — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:POST /api/bet/place\nHeaders: **X-User-Access-Token**, **X-Request-Id**\n(snowflake from **POST /api/bet/snowflake**);

|BetPlaceController|
:requireAuthenticatedUser() via trait;
|UserFoundationGateway|
:Memo / cache by token hash;
if (cache miss?) then (yes)
  |Foundation user API|
  :GET **/api/user/me**\nheader **X-User-Access-Token**;
endif
|UserFoundationGateway|
:Return user payload;
|BetPlaceController|
:**requirePlaceRequestId** (**X-Request-Id** positive decimal);
:Validate body **lines** (exactly one line,\nmarket_id, outcome_code, stake_points, expected_odds_millis);

|BetPlaceService|
:If idempotent row exists\n(**BetOrderRepo::findWithLinesByUserIdem**)\nthen return replay;
:Read **bookmaker_uid** from config;
note right
  Repo steps below run inside
  **DB::transaction**
end note
|MarketRepo|
:**lockWithGameAndSubjectsForBet**(market_id);
|SyntheticMatchMarket|
:Resolve odds for **outcome_code**;
if (game/market not open or odds mismatch?) then (yes)
  :throw domain exceptions\n(**SelectionNotAccepting**, **OddsMoved**, etc.);
  stop
endif
|PointsBalanceRepo|
:Lock/create player balance;
:Debit stake (insufficient → **InsufficientPointsException**);
|BetOrderRepo|
:Insert **BetOrder** + **BetOrderLine**;
:Insert **PointsFlow** (stake);
|BetPlaceService|
:Injected **PointsAdminService** — **creditBookmakerAcceptedStake**\n(service layer only: repo does not call services);

|BetPlaceController|
:Call **MallDictionaryService** resolve(['bet_order_status']);
:**logHandledApiRequest**;
:Return **ApiResponse::ok** +\nHTTP **201** (new) or **200** (replay);

|Client|
:200/201 JSON;
stop

@enduml
